window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Coming to Black Veil University irreversibly changed my life.</p> <p>Meeting Daxton Pierce flipped it on end and made me question everything I know.</p> <p>My memories and my family had been ripped from me. I have been stalked, tortured, abandoned, and betrayed...but I’m not broken.</p> <p>This world is not what I thought it to be, and while my new relationships only grow stronger by the day, tensions rise, bringing new and old enemies to our door.</p> <p>Only this time, I don't have to face them alone.</p> <p>I’ve learned there are worse things in life than the monsters hiding in the shadows, and I’m done cowering in fear.</p> <p><i>Knight Awakened</i> is book 4 of 5 in the Black Veil University. This is a university-aged, Paranormal RH romance between one FMC and her six mates, which means there will be no choosing between love interests at the end of the story.</p> <p>Black Veil University has darker elements that listeners should be aware of such as, strong language, PTSD from kidnapping, assault, and violence.</p>"; 
